Package: DMRqr
Type: Package
Title: Identification of Differentially Methylated Regions Using Quantile Regression
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Linfang", family = "Lyu", role = "aut"),
    person(given = "Weiwei", family = "Duan", email = "passion@njmu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides functions to identify differentially methylated regions 
    from DNA methylation data using quantile regression, with support for 
    covariate adjustment and Aggregated Cauchy Association Test (ACAT)-based 
    combination of p-values across quantile levels.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Imports: 
    MASS,
    quantreg
